<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7341"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Featherw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Featherw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 14, 2005 - 11:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Oh how interesting... a BTK and maintenance of FREIGHT cars...probably a coincidence..but interesting...  <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.wfk-kl.de/englisch/news/news01.html" target=_top>http://www.wfk-kl.de/englisch/news/news01.html</a>  <BR>Business Notes  <BR>BTK  <BR> <BR>The Bahntechnik Kaiserslautern GmbH build a new workshop. The investment of about 3,1 million € will be subsidized by funds of the European Union, the Federal Government and the State of Rheinland-Pfalz in the amount of 300.000 €.  <BR> <BR>The BTK is active in corrective repair, maintenance and modernization of freight cars and components. The central plant for rework, repair and maintenance of train equipments of the Keystone Europe group &#40;BTK belong to&#41; is located in Kaiserslautern. Most important customer is the Deutsche Bahn AG. Keystone Europe is the largest company group of the American corporate group Amstedt Industries in Europe. Head office is in Chicago. Amstedt Industries is represented in 11 countries with altogether 9.200 employees. BTK is one of the biggest production facilities of Kaiserslautern with 250 employees. The new workshop will secure 14 job positions.  <BR>==========================================  <BR>GENERAL TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR EQUIPMENT DELIVERY TO OAO ... - ... specifications are intended for standardisation and unification of geometry checking benches ... number 3. bench drawing number 4. stamp of BTK &#40;quality inspection ... <a href="http://tportal.vaz.ru/otu2000/tom12en.pdf" target=_top>http://tportal.vaz.ru/otu2000/tom12en.pdf</a>  <BR> <BR>====SIDENOTE: THERE is also an OTK STamp of quality..======== <BR> <BR>============================================ <BR> <BR>Anomalous proximity effect in multiterminal S/QD/S junctions - ... of voltage for the short etched samples&#40;batch B&#41;, in a type I geometry. ... Within the standard BTK model, the ratio between the subgap resistance and the normal ... <a href="http://www.ub.rug.nl/eldoc/dis/science/a.t.filip/c9.pdf=========" target=_top>http://www.ub.rug.nl/eldoc/dis/science/a.t.filip/c 9.pdf=========</a>  <BR> <BR>====================================== <BR> <BR>GENERAL TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR EQUIPMENT DELIVERY TO OAO ... - ... specifications are intended for standardisation and unification of geometry checking benches ... number 3. bench drawing number 4. stamp of BTK &#40;quality inspection ... <a href="http://tportal.vaz.ru/otu2000/tom12en.pdf" target=_top>http://tportal.vaz.ru/otu2000/tom12en.pdf</a>  <BR> <BR>============================================= <BR> <BR>The Spectral Conductance of a Proximity Superconductor and the ... - ... 10 showed a clear discrepancy with the BTK theory: in a confined geometry the conductance of a NIS tunnel junction does not go to zero at zero temperature but ... <a href="http://www.kluweronline.com/article.asp?PIPS=412499&amp;PDF=1" target=_top>http://www.kluweronline.com/article.asp?PIPS=41249 9&amp;PDF=1</a> [More results from <a href="http://www.kluweronline.com" target=_top>www.kluweronline.com</a>]   <BR>  <BR>  <BR> <BR> <BR>[PDF] GENERAL TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS FOR EQUIPMENT DELIVERY TO OAO ... <BR>File Format: PDF/Adobe Acrobat - View as HTML <BR>Your browser may not have a PDF reader available. Google recommends visiting our text version of this document. <BR>... the plate: 1. bench designation 2. car unit, component drawing number 3. bench drawing <BR>number 4. stamp of BTK &#40;quality inspection bureau&#41; of the manufacturer. ...  <BR>tportal.vaz.ru/otu2000/tom12en.pdf - Similar pages  <BR>  <BR>============================<!--/Text--></td></tr>
